{"seq":4,"slug":"jotai-and-signals","title":"Jotai 与 Signals","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/jotai-and-signals","wordCount":726,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"jotai-与-signals\">Jotai 与 Signals</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>与 Redux、Zustand 的集中式 store 不同，Jotai 把状态拆分为最小粒度的原子（Atom），组件只订阅自己需要的原子，从而获得真正的细粒度更新。派生 atom 会自动追踪依赖，读写还可以用 <code>useAtomValue</code> / <code>useSetAtom</code> 进一步分离。本章讲解原子化模型、派生与异步 atom 的用法，并延伸到 TC39 的 Signals 提案与基于 push 的细粒度响应式方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原子化状态管理\">原子化状态管理</h2><p>传统状态管理（Redux、Zustand）使用集中式 store，所有状态合并在一个地方。<strong>Jotai</strong> 采用截然不同的思路——将状态拆分为最小粒度的<strong>原子（Atom）</strong>，组件直接订阅所需的原子，实现真正的细粒度更新。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 集中式 Store&#10;        A[Store] --&gt; B[state.user]&#10;        A --&gt; C[state.theme]&#10;        A --&gt; D[state.todos]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 原子化&#10;        E[&quot;atom(user)&quot;]&#10;        F[&quot;atom(theme)&quot;]&#10;        G[&quot;atom(todos)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    E --&gt; H[组件 A]&#10;    F --&gt; I[组件 B]&#10;    G --&gt; J[组件 C]\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 集中式 Store\n        A[Store] --&gt; B[state.user]\n        A --&gt; C[state.theme]\n        A --&gt; D[state.todos]\n    end\n    subgraph 原子化\n        E[\"atom(user)\"]\n        F[\"atom(theme)\"]\n        G[\"atom(todos)\"]\n    end\n    E --&gt; H[组件 A]\n    F --&gt; I[组件 B]\n    G --&gt; J[组件 C]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Jotai</th>\n<th>Zustand</th>\n<th>Redux</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模型</td>\n<td>原子化</td>\n<td>集中式</td>\n<td>集中式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provider</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小订阅粒度</td>\n<td>单个 atom</td>\n<td>selector 函数</td>\n<td>selector 函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包体积</td>\n<td>~3KB</td>\n<td>~1KB</td>\n<td>~12KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派生状态</td>\n<td>内置（derived atom）</td>\n<td>手动计算</td>\n<td>createSelector</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基础用法\">基础用法</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { atom, useAtom, useAtomValue, useSetAtom } from &#39;jotai&#39;;&#10;&#10;const countAtom = atom(0);&#10;const nameAtom = atom(&#39;React&#39;);&#10;&#10;function Counter() {&#10;  const [count, setCount] = useAtom(countAtom);&#10;  return &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setCount((c) =&gt; c + 1)}&gt;计数: {count}&lt;/button&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function NameDisplay() {&#10;  const name = useAtomValue(nameAtom);&#10;  return &lt;span&gt;名称: {name}&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function NameEditor() {&#10;  const setName = useSetAtom(nameAtom);&#10;  return &lt;input onChange={(e) =&gt; setName(e.target.value)} placeholder=&quot;输入名称&quot; /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { atom, useAtom, useAtomValue, useSetAtom } from 'jotai';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const countAtom = atom(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const nameAtom = atom('React');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Counter() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [count, setCount] = useAtom(countAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;button onClick={() => setCount((c) => c + 1)}>计数: {count}&#x3C;/button>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function NameDisplay() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const name = useAtomValue(nameAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;span>名称: {name}&#x3C;/span>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function NameEditor() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const setName = useSetAtom(nameAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;input onChange={(e) => setName(e.target.value)} placeholder=\"输入名称\" />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>useAtomValue</code> 只读取值不返回 setter，<code>useSetAtom</code> 只返回 setter 不订阅值。合理使用可以进一步减少不必要的重渲染。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"derived-atoms\">Derived Atoms</h2><p>Jotai 的 <strong>derived atom</strong> 从其他 atom 派生状态，当依赖的 atom 变化时自动重新计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface TodoItem {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  text: string;&#10;  completed: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const todosAtom = atom&lt;TodoItem[]&gt;([]);&#10;const filterAtom = atom&lt;&#39;all&#39; | &#39;active&#39; | &#39;completed&#39;&gt;(&#39;all&#39;);&#10;&#10;const filteredTodosAtom = atom((get) =&gt; {&#10;  const todos = get(todosAtom);&#10;  const filter = get(filterAtom);&#10;&#10;  switch (filter) {&#10;    case &#39;active&#39;:&#10;      return todos.filter((t) =&gt; !t.completed);&#10;    case &#39;completed&#39;:&#10;      return todos.filter((t) =&gt; t.completed);&#10;    default:&#10;      return todos;&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;&#10;const statsAtom = atom((get) =&gt; {&#10;  const todos = get(todosAtom);&#10;  return {&#10;    total: todos.length,&#10;    active: todos.filter((t) =&gt; !t.completed).length,&#10;    completed: todos.filter((t) =&gt; t.completed).length,&#10;  };&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface TodoItem {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  text: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  completed: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const todosAtom = atom&#x3C;TodoItem[]>([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const filterAtom = atom&#x3C;'all' | 'active' | 'completed'>('all');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const filteredTodosAtom = atom((get) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const todos = get(todosAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const filter = get(filterAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  switch (filter) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    case 'active':</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return todos.filter((t) => !t.completed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    case 'completed':</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return todos.filter((t) => t.completed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    default:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return todos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const statsAtom = atom((get) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const todos = get(todosAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    total: todos.length,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    active: todos.filter((t) => !t.completed).length,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    completed: todos.filter((t) => t.completed).length,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;todosAtom (原始)&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;filteredTodosAtom (派生)&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;filterAtom (原始)&quot;] --&gt; C&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;statsAtom (派生)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"todosAtom (原始)\"] --&gt; C[\"filteredTodosAtom (派生)\"]\n    B[\"filterAtom (原始)\"] --&gt; C\n    A --&gt; D[\"statsAtom (派生)\"]</pre><h3 id=\"可写派生-atom\">可写派生 Atom</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"const uppercaseAtom = atom(&#10;  (get) =&gt; get(nameAtom).toUpperCase(),&#10;  (get, set, newValue: string) =&gt; {&#10;    set(nameAtom, newValue.toLowerCase());&#10;  },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const uppercaseAtom = atom(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (get) => get(nameAtom).toUpperCase(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (get, set, newValue: string) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    set(nameAtom, newValue.toLowerCase());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"异步-atom\">异步 Atom</h2><p>Jotai 原生支持异步 atom，与 Suspense 无缝集成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"const userIdAtom = atom(1);&#10;&#10;const userAtom = atom(async (get) =&gt; {&#10;  const id = get(userIdAtom);&#10;  const response = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`);&#10;  return response.json() as Promise&lt;User&gt;;&#10;});&#10;&#10;function UserProfile() {&#10;  const user = useAtomValue(userAtom);&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;{user.name}&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;Spinner /&gt;}&gt;&#10;      &lt;UserProfile /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const userIdAtom = atom(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const userAtom = atom(async (get) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const id = get(userIdAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const response = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return response.json() as Promise&#x3C;User>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function UserProfile() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const user = useAtomValue(userAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>{user.name}&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;Spinner />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;UserProfile /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Atom 类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原始 atom</td>\n<td><code>atom(initialValue)</code></td>\n<td>可读可写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只读派生</td>\n<td><code>atom((get) =&gt; ...)</code></td>\n<td>自动追踪依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可写派生</td>\n<td><code>atom((get) =&gt; ..., (get, set, val) =&gt; ...)</code></td>\n<td>自定义写入逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步 atom</td>\n<td><code>atom(async (get) =&gt; ...)</code></td>\n<td>配合 Suspense</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"signal-提案与细粒度响应式\">Signal 提案与细粒度响应式</h2><p><strong>Signals</strong> 是一种细粒度响应式原语，已被 TC39 提案引入（Stage 1）。与 React 的 &quot;pull&quot; 模型（组件重渲染时拉取最新状态）不同，Signals 采用 &quot;push&quot; 模型——状态变化时自动推送更新到订阅的 UI 片段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph React 模型&#10;        A[State 变化] --&gt; B[标记组件需要更新]&#10;        B --&gt; C[重新执行组件函数]&#10;        C --&gt; D[diff 虚拟 DOM]&#10;        D --&gt; E[更新真实 DOM]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Signal 模型&#10;        F[Signal 变化] --&gt; G[直接更新绑定的 DOM]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph React 模型\n        A[State 变化] --&gt; B[标记组件需要更新]\n        B --&gt; C[重新执行组件函数]\n        C --&gt; D[diff 虚拟 DOM]\n        D --&gt; E[更新真实 DOM]\n    end\n    subgraph Signal 模型\n        F[Signal 变化] --&gt; G[直接更新绑定的 DOM]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"signal-的核心概念\">Signal 的核心概念</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Signal&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  get value(): T;&#10;  set value(newValue: T);&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Computed&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  get value(): T;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// TC39 Signal 提案伪代码&#10;const count = new Signal.State(0);&#10;const doubled = new Signal.Computed(() =&gt; count.value * 2);&#10;&#10;const effect = new Signal.subtle.Watcher(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;count changed:&#39;, count.value);&#10;});&#10;effect.watch(count);&#10;&#10;count.value = 5;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Signal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  get</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  set</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">newValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  get</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TC39 Signal 提案伪代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Signal.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">State</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> doubled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Signal.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> effect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Signal.subtle.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Watcher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'count changed:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, count.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">effect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">watch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>对应 React</th>\n<th>对应 Jotai</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Signal.State</td>\n<td>useState</td>\n<td>atom(value)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Signal.Computed</td>\n<td>useMemo</td>\n<td>atom((get) =&gt; ...)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Signal.subtle.Watcher</td>\n<td>useEffect</td>\n<td>onMount</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"fine-grained-reactivity\">Fine-Grained Reactivity</h2><p>细粒度响应式的核心优势是跳过组件级别的 diff，直接更新变化的 DOM 片段。在 React 生态中，Jotai 配合 <code>@jotai/react</code> 已经实现了接近细粒度的更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"const priceAtom = atom(100);&#10;const taxRateAtom = atom(0.1);&#10;const totalAtom = atom((get) =&gt; {&#10;  const price = get(priceAtom);&#10;  const taxRate = get(taxRateAtom);&#10;  return price * (1 + taxRate);&#10;});&#10;&#10;function PriceDisplay() {&#10;  const price = useAtomValue(priceAtom);&#10;  return &lt;span&gt;价格: ¥{price}&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function TotalDisplay() {&#10;  const total = useAtomValue(totalAtom);&#10;  return &lt;span&gt;总计: ¥{total.toFixed(2)}&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function TaxRateControl() {&#10;  const setTaxRate = useSetAtom(taxRateAtom);&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;select onChange={(e) =&gt; setTaxRate(Number(e.target.value))}&gt;&#10;      &lt;option value=&quot;0.1&quot;&gt;10%&lt;/option&gt;&#10;      &lt;option value=&quot;0.13&quot;&gt;13%&lt;/option&gt;&#10;      &lt;option value=&quot;0.17&quot;&gt;17%&lt;/option&gt;&#10;    &lt;/select&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const priceAtom = atom(100);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const taxRateAtom = atom(0.1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const totalAtom = atom((get) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const price = get(priceAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const taxRate = get(taxRateAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return price * (1 + taxRate);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function PriceDisplay() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const price = useAtomValue(priceAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;span>价格: ¥{price}&#x3C;/span>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function TotalDisplay() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const total = useAtomValue(totalAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;span>总计: ¥{total.toFixed(2)}&#x3C;/span>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function TaxRateControl() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const setTaxRate = useSetAtom(taxRateAtom);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;select onChange={(e) => setTaxRate(Number(e.target.value))}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;option value=\"0.1\">10%&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;option value=\"0.13\">13%&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;option value=\"0.17\">17%&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/select></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当 <code>taxRateAtom</code> 变化时：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>PriceDisplay</code> <strong>不会</strong>重渲染（未订阅 taxRateAtom）</li>\n<li><code>TotalDisplay</code> 会重渲染（totalAtom 依赖 taxRateAtom）</li>\n<li><code>TaxRateControl</code> <strong>不会</strong>重渲染（只使用 setter）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;taxRateAtom 变化&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;totalAtom 重新计算&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;TotalDisplay 重渲染&quot;]&#10;    A -. 不影响 .-&gt; D[&quot;PriceDisplay&quot;]&#10;    A -. 不影响 .-&gt; E[&quot;TaxRateControl&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"taxRateAtom 变化\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"totalAtom 重新计算\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"TotalDisplay 重渲染\"]\n    A -. 不影响 .-&gt; D[\"PriceDisplay\"]\n    A -. 不影响 .-&gt; E[\"TaxRateControl\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Signals 仍处于提案阶段，React 团队对其态度谨慎。目前在 React 中实现细粒度响应式的最佳方案是使用 Jotai 的原子模型，或者 Preact 的 <code>@preact/signals-react</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Jotai</strong> 采用原子化模型，每个 atom 是最小状态单元，组件按需订阅</li>\n<li><strong>Derived atom</strong> 自动追踪依赖，支持同步和异步派生</li>\n<li><code>useAtomValue</code> 和 <code>useSetAtom</code> 分离读写，进一步减少不必要的重渲染</li>\n<li><strong>Signals</strong> 是 TC39 Stage 1 提案，采用 push 模型实现细粒度 DOM 更新</li>\n<li>在 React 生态中，Jotai 的原子模型是当前最接近细粒度响应式的方案</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Jotai 与 Signals","id":"jotai-与-signals"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"原子化状态管理","id":"原子化状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"基础用法","id":"基础用法"},{"level":2,"text":"Derived Atoms","id":"derived-atoms"},{"level":3,"text":"可写派生 Atom","id":"可写派生-atom"},{"level":2,"text":"异步 Atom","id":"异步-atom"},{"level":2,"text":"Signal 提案与细粒度响应式","id":"signal-提案与细粒度响应式"},{"level":3,"text":"Signal 的核心概念","id":"signal-的核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Fine-Grained Reactivity","id":"fine-grained-reactivity"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Redux Toolkit 状态管理工具集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/redux-toolkit"},"next":{"title":"复合组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/compound-components"}}